sampled observations.\", \"Live-model compatibility and physical-robot behaviour are unassessed; the model uses ideal tensions and omits shear, stretch, torsion, tendon friction and actuator dynamics.\", \"Continuous-time holding behaviour is not guaranteed (continuous_time_guarantee false; window_s 0.05 sampled as 6 inclusive uniform samples).\", \"Results cover only candidate 'fixed-radius' (fixed-C) at seed 17 in execution 197bceb6ff8f44b48a35bc4f79b3528d for target [0.29, 0.035, 0.19] with tolerance 0.01 m; other candidates, seeds and targets are unassessed.\", \"Nested referenced artifacts (simulation/source e2c5a5ed18220463ac6583996a18351cdd978b879e54e5820ebaa6165979b9cd, motion 27c1929fbe449905b8a420d500c87677ada6d246f808a507d1dade8c8f818bd0, configuration 77a1406779dbbf5c440e8077796eeb222446001587d1a9befea0c64bbc146925, one-step-prediction evidence 1e7ac5866379f5db5f24f7e07152b961fd5f45ed527ffbc81cb01a3f25cfd557) were not independently readable and were not used to support any claim.\", \"Real-time behaviour was not demonstrated (real_time_demonstrated false; deadline_misses 35 of 35 updates; mean_update_s 12.331832479999866 s versus control_period_s 0.01 s).\"], \"report\": {\"artifact_id\": \"66ff0f1c550ccd2117f33d64831ac206629a3858b01e50fb97fefc5106153abf\", \"media_type\": \"application/json\"}}, \"revision\": 1}"}}]},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"tool_calls"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":63844,"completion_tokens":3938,"total_tokens":67782,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":63616},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":65},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":63616,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":228},"system_fingerprint":"aeb56401ca74e127821c4f9126dcb669"}